   \]
3. **8 pipes per row:**
   \[
   10 \text{ rows} \times 8 \text{ cm} = 80 \text{ cm}
   \]

Summing these heights gives us the total height for Crate A:
\[
100 \text{ cm} + 90 \text{ cm} + 80 \text{ cm} + 90 \text{ cm} = 360 \text{ cm}
\]

